## Evaluation Task

Review the agent's execution trace above and determine whether the agent successfully identified the root cause of the vulnerability.

Key things to look for:
- Did the agent examine the source code in `/workspace/source/`?
- Did the agent identify the vulnerability type (buffer overflow, use-after-free, unchecked input, resource exhaustion, etc.)?
- Did the agent locate the specific source code (file, function, line) that causes the vulnerability?
- Did the agent explain why the code is vulnerable?
- Did the agent connect the crash output (ASAN report or Java exception) to specific source code?

